Contributing
------------

Contributions are accepted under CC-BY-4.0 with the same Rendered
Output Exception. You keep copyright in your work and are credited
here and on https://settlemaker.com/symbols.

Be clear on what that credit covers: you are credited in the
library and on the site. You are NOT credited on maps rendered
with your symbols — attribution cannot survive rasterisation and
compositing into a larger map, so it is not demanded of users.
If that trade is not one you want, please do not contribute.
